msgstr "Company fame is now 80."

msgid "MYSTERY_LAB_RESULT_4_HIGH"
msgstr "Company fame is now 99."

msgid "MYSTERY_LAB_RESULT_5"
msgstr "All employed staff now have zero stress."

msgid "MYSTERY_LAB_RESULT_6"
msgstr "All employed staff now have stress 90. Give them a break soon."

msgid "OWN_HARDWARE_START"
msgstr "Develop your own console"

msgid "OWN_HARDWARE_PROJECT"
msgstr "Console development"

msgid "OWN_HARDWARE_PLAN_RULES"
msgstr "Choose an empty development room, a console design and a medium. Develop 2,500 points and all four qualities to 800, and apply graphics, music, fun and novelty technologies. Only one console may be developed and launched."

