msgstr "I hoped we could keep making games together."

msgid "FINANCIAL_FAILURE_REACTION_1"
msgstr "I will miss working here."

msgid "FINANCIAL_FAILURE_REACTION_2"
msgstr "Thank you for everything I learned."

msgid "FINANCIAL_FAILURE_REACTION_3"
msgstr "This is a difficult goodbye."

msgid "FINANCIAL_FAILURE_REACTION_4"
msgstr "I wish our next game could have reached the players."

msgid "FINANCIAL_FAILURE_REACTION_5"
msgstr "We did what we could. I hope we meet again."

msgid "FINANCIAL_FAILURE_REACTION_6"
msgstr "I will remember the games we made."

msgid "FINANCIAL_FAILURE_REACTION_7"
msgstr "Good luck with whatever comes next."

